Error: Jet.PayloadCaseWithIntBacking: `#Layout(U8)` backs only a payload-free enum, and case `Text` of `Reply` carries a payload
  --> Tests/UI/enum_from_int_payload.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #Layout(U8)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A backing type gives each case one number; a case with fields is more than a number
 Fix: Remove the payload from `Text`, or remove `#Layout(U8)` and convert with your own methods
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.PayloadCaseWithIntBacking
